{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EY31xz26lF1792684001.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>臺日電梯未有為升降機安裝門框組件，機電署指相關兩個租置屋邨及229幢私人樓宇，有關勘察和安裝工程已展開，並暫緩公布該公司最新表現評級結果。</p><p></p><p>機電署指由於巡查發現，臺日電梯更換的升降機工程嚴重失誤，因此暫緩公布。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LIFT-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kOqwcLGqls1792684259.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>至於瑪麗醫院新臨床大樓多部升降機出問題，涉事承建商安力電梯，安全表現評級及服務質素表現評級，分別獲1星及3星，即安全方面沒有發現問題，服務質素表現獲90至99分。</p><p></p><p>今次評級的評核期，由去年10月至今年9月，有17間註冊升降機承辦商，和14間註冊自動梯承辦商，獲最高表現級別。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:40:38.942964+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":243,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T02:18:14.242784+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:38:09.828098+00:00","content_hash":"f7260532170c4b318618e8b4747e9cb77d9e222bcf1232c7d71abbb0307b16a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}